# 2026-08-05 audit: eval_results_20260531*, the small _latency_diag* json/log files
# (docs/LATENCY_ROOT_CAUSE.md cites these by file:line as raw evidence — "throwaway
# instrumentation" was the wrong call for something a doc actually cites), the eval_charts
# PNGs, eval_partial_latest.json, and _pr12_smoke_out.txt are all now committed, not
# ignored — see gg-portfolio's provenance.md wave 19 section. Still ignored below: the raw
# nvidia-smi telemetry CSV (3MB of samples, not a scorecard) and reports/eval_run.log /
# reports/harness_logs/ (1.3MB+ raw execution traces, covered by the blanket *.log above).
reports/_latency_diag_nvidia_smi.csv
!reports/_latency_diag.log
!reports/_latency_diag_1024.log
!reports/_latency_diag_lora_unfused.log

# Paper LaTeX build output — generated by docs/paper/latex/build.sh from tracked source
# (abstract_source.md, main.tex); never hand-edited or committed. Regenerate on demand
# before an actual arXiv upload. Tracking these invited exactly the failure this excludes:
# a hand-patched/hand-retyped copy of generated content silently drifting from its source
# (docs/paper/arxiv_submission_prep.md's abstract blockquote drifted 3 characters from
# the real abstract this way, caught by an independent verifier pass, not by inspection).
docs/paper/latex/abstract_body.tex
docs/paper/latex/body_content.tex
docs/paper/latex/main.pdf
docs/paper/latex/build_log.txt
